END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:planetenuhr-en-planet-2027-08-25-venus-jupiter-conjunction@marsrakete.github.io
DTSTAMP:20260805T170001Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270825
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270826
SUMMARY:Venus-Jupiter conjunction
CATEGORIES:PLANET
DESCRIPTION:Sichtbarkeit: Very close to the Sun\; difficult or unsafe to observe\n\nGeometrically close\, but only about 4 degrees from the Sun. Do not search with optical aid near the Sun.
X-PLANETENUHR-VISIBILITY:Very close to the Sun\; difficult or unsafe to observe
END:VEVENT
